1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
A golden mango. The challenge: circle the world three times.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Kartikeya soared away on his peacock, eager to begin.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Ganesha paused. Then he looked at his mother and father.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
With quiet devotion, he walked around them once.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
A second circle. His parents watched with gentle smiles.

6
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
A third circle. Ganesha stopped before them.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
For Ganesha, his parents were his whole world.

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
Returning, Kartikeya understood what his brother had seen.

9
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:45,000
The mango went to Ganesha. Wisdom had found another way.
